       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CINEMATIC-LUT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CINEMATIC-LUT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-3D-LUT-TETRAHEDRAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CINEFEX-SPECTRAL-RECON   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRIPARTITE-COLOR-WARP-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-RANGE-LOG-CLAMP  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RGB-TO-IR-COLOR-BIJECT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CINEMATIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CINEMATIC-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CINEMATIC-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TETRAHEDRAL-AND-SPECTRAL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TRIPARTITE-COLOR-WARP.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-LOG-AND-BIJECTIVITY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-CINEMATIC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TETRAHEDRAL-AND-SPECTRAL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-3D-LUT-TETRAHEDRAL-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CINEFEX-SPECTRAL-RECON.
       2000-EVALUATE-TRIPARTITE-COLOR-WARP.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRIPARTITE-COLOR-WARP-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-LOG-AND-BIJECTIVITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-RANGE-LOG-CLAMP.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RGB-TO-IR-COLOR-BIJECT-OK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-CINEMATIC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-3D-LUT-TETRAHEDRAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CINEFEX-SPECTRAL-RECON = 1 AND
              WS-TRIPARTITE-COLOR-WARP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-RANGE-LOG-CLAMP = 1 AND
              WS-RGB-TO-IR-COLOR-BIJECT-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CINEMATIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CINEMATIC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CINEMATIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CINEMATIC-CODE.
